草祭清明。\n晚风吹落携锄艇，又听?辀隔水声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41854,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与景星夜坐","author":"陈献章","text":"拨闷无人致酒瓶，哦诗灯下一郎清。\n夜深笑拍胡床语，忽乱阶前落叶声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41855,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵山下感旧 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"西风吹老锦岩春，遗迹荒凉此水滨。\n云气不遮西望眼，青山刚对独归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41856,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵山下感旧 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"西樵山前暝鹤归，缟衣双拂锦屏飞。\n凄凉夜半孤舟客，一听遗音泪满衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41857,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西樵山下感旧 其三","author":"陈献章","text":"德孚先生留此眠，南山挥手白沙船。\n江山此日三人别，谁道人生无百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41858,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"示建旌节亭役者","author":"陈献章","text":"照曜乾坤功不小，此风此日更须扶。\n泮宫畚土皆民力，不共城郎一例书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41859,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵赵提学留别白沙","author":"陈献章","text":"列炬溪边树影斜，隔花遥迓使君车。\n酒杯欲别微风起，吹动馨香下柳沙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41860,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蕉丽望罗浮","author":"陈献章","text":"翠锦为山白锦云，画工传影不传神。\n今朝蕉丽江头望，魂爽何由得傍身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41861,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"黄连滘即事","author":"陈献章","text":"青草桥边船未归，曲川微雨暗荆扉。\n江村尽日无来往，夫在东皋妇给炊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41862,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上帆","author":"陈献章","text":"蜻蜓翅短不能飞，款款随风堕客衣。\n此是天人相合处，蒲帆高挂北风归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41863,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"落花","author":"陈献章","text":"落花半落流水香，鸣鸠互鸣春日长。\n美人别我隔江浦，欲来不来空断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41864,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清晓","author":"陈献章","text":"清晓有人来款扉，风吹衫袖白披披。\n昨宵雨打山窗破，莫怪先生下榻迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41865,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜生侄","author":"陈献章","text":"两翁筋力少翁衰，竹杖先堪付若儿。\n只恐暮年诗更逸，出门须背锦囊随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41866,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新设纸帐轩中 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"如云白纸罩方床，翠簟眠穿我固当。\n世到葛天终不远，先生枕外即羲皇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41867,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新设纸帐轩中 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"阶面苔侵牡蛎墙，小轩容易领年光。\n只从今夜床头月，已照先生鬓脚霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41868,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗三首 其一","author":"陈献章","text":"十年自汗不曾乾，枕上残书白首看。\n莫道无心与君别，樽前更觉别君难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41869,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂诗三首 其二","author":"陈献章","text":"人间骨肉薄秋云，一事朝来不忍闻。\n何处青山封宿草，欲将衰泪洒孤坟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41870,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿倪麟所石榴花秋开","author":"陈献章","text":"老蟾半影秋如水，曙色一声霜满街。\n白发山人到城府，石榴花下借眠来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41871,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"催诸友九日诗课","author":"陈献章","text":"九日楼前客令新，黄花爱酒不饶贫。\n劝君火急交诗课，才到明朝罚主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41872,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题杜少陵小影次韵柳文肃","author":"陈献章","text":"孟子诗肩高耸山，杜陵谈笑古风还。\n世间还对忧时画，美酒花前已破颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41873,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与旧童子","author":"陈献章","text":"神药烧茶伴老夫，昔时童子今生须。\n青春过眼如白水，白雪满头非故吾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41874,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢惠酒","author":"陈献章","text":"白发苍颜老石斋，出门秋思满天涯。\n极怜紫酒逡巡有，不负黄花点缀佳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41875,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"五月二十七夜?风作屋漏","author":"陈献章","text":"灯残四壁漏痕斜，老屋回风落细沙。\n乾坤更有晴明日，为报家人莫怨嗟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41876,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"陈献章","text":"赤壁矶头天欲曙，缟衣和梦掠舟西。\n欲寻故处何由见，长恨今人画亦非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":41877,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]